Caelza M3: the xanima brain service as a native memory backend.

Adds `[storage.xanima.<alias>]` to the config schema, `MemoryBackendKind::Xanima`
and its onboarding profile to the memory crate, the factory branch that builds
`XanimaMemory` (the overlay file crates/caelza-memory/src/xanima.rs), the
attribution kind, and the dashboard storage picker entry. Applied by
runtime/build.sh after the rename; regenerate with the same `diff -u` when the
upstream pin moves.

